OL,3,GNEWSA'I will never let my murdered
OL,4,Asister's voice be silenced'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanel Walsh says she will fight for
OL,7,F"as long as I still have breath" to
OL,8,Fmake sure her sister Chereiss Bailey's
OL,9,Fvoice is heard.
OL,11,F"It's not just about her choosing her
OL,12,Flife, it's the way she lost her life.
OL,13,FIt was just so brutal. Just to think
OL,14,Fwhat she would have gone through breaks
OL,15,Fmy heart," Walsh says.
OL,17,FShe has spoken out after Bailey, who
OL,18,Fhad a six-month-old son, was murdered
OL,19,Fin October 2025, before her body was
OL,20,Fweighted down and dumped in a canal in
OL,21,Fthe West Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
